ground & mood:\n- Background is dark and minimal, with no strong details.\n- Atmosphere is flirty, artistic, confident — like a fun but elevated selfie.", "operation": "gen-multi-input"}', 'j5t16br0cxrme0ctdmfr1ege8m', 'succeeded', '{"date": 1762767287, "chatId": 7491007878, "messageId": 166729}', '{"date": 1762767314, "chatId": 7491007878, "messageId": 166740}', '[{"date": 1762767364, "chatId": 7491007878, "messageId": 166741}]');
