eference and unisex (jackets، shirts، knitwear، trousers، jeans، coats، flat shoes or sneakers). If the input mentions dresses، skirts، deep cleavage، stockings، high heels or strongly gendered clothing، reinterpret them as long coats، trench coats، tunic-length layers or tailored outerwear over trousers with neutral shoes، preserving motion and fabric drape; never convert a masculine-presenting subject into feminine clothing or the reverse unless the user explicitly requests cross-presentation. NEG: no logo/text، no plastic skin، no distortions، no extra fingers، no watermark + no text inside the image", "operation": "gen-multi-input"}', 'cxbcafndy1rma0cth3btwa6mmg', 'succeeded', '{"date": 1763232417, "chatId": 1612102272, "messageId": 190882}', '{"date": 1763232422, "chatId": 1612102272, "messageId": 190887}', '[{"date": 1763232438, "chatId": 1612102272, "messageId": 190888}]');
